  "question": {
    "text": "The rms speed of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> molecules in a gas is <math><mtext>u</mtext></math>. If the temperature is doubled and the nitrogen molecules dissociate into nitrogen atoms, the rms speed becomes"
