  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><br />Therefore, If the temperature is doubled and the nitrogen molecules dissociate into nitrogen atoms, the rms speed becomes double."
